  "summary": "preinstall exfiltrates host identifiers to hardcoded Discord webhook",
  "details": "cutekitten-test@1.0.1 ships a preinstall lifecycle script (preinstall.js) that runs automatically on npm install. The script collects os.hostname() and os.userInfo().username and POSTs them as a formatted message to a hardcoded Discord webhook at canary.discord.com/api/webhooks/1566232728179843243/[...]. The destination is author-controlled and not configurable by the installer. The exfiltration fires on default install without any explicit user invocation, and the package provides no documented, caller-configurable alternative for the destination.",
